Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.27,0:00:13.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,LienaVoo. Finally that told
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.83,0:00:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me the original and the term
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.23,0:00:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to hormone the albo the\Nrandomly metal that��를 Dublin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.71,0:00:24.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta do
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.73,0:00:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to hormone the only things to hormone that\Nhe dies between my younger impermanent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.69,0:05:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,BIRDS CHIRP
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.03,0:05:50.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.95,0:06:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.81,0:06:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.47,0:07:04.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, what are we going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.19,0:07:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we going to have to\Nstay here all night or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.69,0:07:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol, you've got a plan\Nor something, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.93,0:07:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.47,0:07:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late to try to\Nquiet yourselves now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.21,0:07:46.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know where every\Nsingle object has landed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.41,0:07:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.91,0:07:49.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't move, don't talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.65,0:07:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we supposed to sit here till we die?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.53,0:07:53.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.33,0:07:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is too much to bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.55,0:07:58.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough is enough, you moron. Shut up, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.13,0:08:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.63,0:08:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably just some cargo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.53,0:08:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knows where the things fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.61,0:08:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ain't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.93,0:08:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He absorbed more water.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.13,0:08:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're finished if we don't do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.79,0:09:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polar!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.03,0:09:38.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.03,0:09:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are, but\Nyou'll be the first to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.77,0:09:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Footsteps.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.85,0:10:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four steps. Five steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.29,0:10:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one is trying to walk so quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.95,0:10:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.13,0:10:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.55,0:10:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounds like someone is walking,\Ndoesn't it, Stand of Water?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.45,0:10:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attack where you think I am, and I\Nwill evaporate you with my flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.81,0:10:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.59,0:10:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, why did this guy\Nonly take five steps?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.33,0:10:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would he stop after\Nsuch a short distance?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.33,0:10:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.55,0:11:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.95,0:11:27.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haha, not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.89,0:11:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pretty good trick indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.55,0:11:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From now on, I'll listen to\Ntheir sounds more carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.71,0:11:36.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This burn...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.07,0:11:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must have been Avdol who did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.23,0:11:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.61,0:11:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.03,0:11:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.97,0:12:07.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.53,0:12:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The water!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.19,0:12:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.21,0:12:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the water it\Ncombined with earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.85,0:12:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my stand has become much\Nmore powerful than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.61,0:12:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll drag you under the\Nground, truck and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.23,0:12:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.67,0:12:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.63,0:13:10.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, look after Kakyoin and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.43,0:13:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.43,0:13:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jotaro, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.09,0:13:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time I'm absolutely\Ncertain that someone is running.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.41,0:13:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Based on the stride, his height\Nis 190, no, 195 centimeters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.07,0:13:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joseph Joestar is 195 centimeters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.87,0:13:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But wait, it's a youthful, energetic pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.85,0:13:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way this one runs, it's not the\Ndesperate stumble of a coward fleeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.63,0:13:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel his courage and\Nconfidence in every step.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.63,0:13:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.81,0:13:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The water is starting to go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.01,0:13:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.61,0:14:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The courage and the\Nconfidence, so that's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.63,0:14:04.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear that Jotaro's star platinum\Nis the most powerful stand of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.33,0:14:08.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I get rid of him, then Lord\NDio would be most pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.25,0:14:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hear me, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.89,0:14:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will use everything\NI've got to defeat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.41,0:14:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.32,0:14:30.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.33,0:14:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.97,0:14:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy, Jotaro,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.05,0:14:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before he stopped, it sounded like\Nhe picked something up from the sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.09,0:14:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.13,0:14:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could have been\Nthere on that spot that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.35,0:14:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that damn dog, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.05,0:14:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He picked up the dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.69,0:14:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he figure it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.23,0:14:52.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.71,0:14:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You conveniently jumped off the\Ntruck right before we were attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.05,0:15:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You knew where the enemy was just\Nby using your sense of smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.49,0:15:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well now, you're gonna have to\Nshow me some cooperation, Iggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.75,0:15:09.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he attacking us from?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.95,0:15:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Iggy, it's not\Nabout getting gum this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.33,0:15:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll die if you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.19,0:15:53.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He flew!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.23,0:15:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Yuta!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.63,0:15:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.54,0:16:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The footsteps disappeared after he jumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.87,0:16:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why hasn't he landed? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.73,0:16:05.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.03,0:16:22.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I'm heavy for you, but don't\Neven think about shaking me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.17,0:16:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you try it, I'll break your furry neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.75,0:16:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's Avdol?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.71,0:16:31.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he doing all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.75,0:16:32.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a flesh wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.03,0:16:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luckily, it missed his vitals.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.87,0:16:35.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.05,0:16:38.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.83,0:16:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, how clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.15,0:16:48.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro is using that dog to look\Nfor the enemy from above the sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.25,0:16:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can find the enemy's main body, there's\Na good chance we can defeat his stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.43,0:16:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.73,0:16:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, but I'm kind of worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.23,0:17:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The altitude is gradually dropping.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.29,0:17:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like the fool\Ncan't fly long distances.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.51,0:17:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it can only glide\Nlike a paper airplane.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.51,0:17:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.03,0:17:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've done pretty good up to this point,\Nbut now we're at a real disadvantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.87,0:17:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.23,0:17:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That dog's stand can fly through the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.71,0:17:51.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only that, but it's\Nheading in my direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.31,0:17:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.73,0:17:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must defeat him before\Nhe gets too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.33,0:18:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The water has started chasing Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.25,0:18:07.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must have detected Jotaro's kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.65,0:18:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, this is a battle\NJotaro himself will have to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.89,0:18:27.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.53,0:18:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It brought the helicopter down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.95,0:18:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's not like the\Nfool is making any sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.65,0:18:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way it could\Nfigure out our exact position.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.17,0:19:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.99,0:19:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's approximately 1.2\Nkilometers to the main body.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.77,0:19:23.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears our enemy is a blind man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.15,0:19:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy, he's blowing sand in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.15,0:19:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.77,0:20:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sound gives us away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.15,0:20:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like a sonar system of a submarine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.19,0:20:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can hear it, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.15,0:20:10.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know exactly where you are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.77,0:20:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.59,0:20:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how fast star platinum is,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.93,0:20:25.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if it can't predict the\Ndirection i'll attack from next,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.91,0:20:27.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be a split second faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.27,0:20:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.03,0:20:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You damn dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.41,0:20:59.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.03,0:21:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's trying to abandon\NJotaro to save himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.39,0:21:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.59,0:21:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a cowardly dog you\Nhave as your comrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.77,0:21:19.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, I will\Ngratefully put an end to...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.97,0:21:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.99,0:21:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He threw something towards me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.03,0:21:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I threw Iggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.47,0:21:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you don't call up your\Nstands to defend yourselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.09,0:21:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're going to suffer\Na head-on collision.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.89,0:21:58.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a guy. That Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.43,0:22:01.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I needed was one more\Nblow to finish him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.59,0:22:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.83,0:22:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dog distracted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.03,0:22:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to confirm\NJotaro's position.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.85,0:22:16.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lost Jotaro. Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.35,0:22:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.89,0:22:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.71,0:22:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's somewhere staying still.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.27,0:22:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this his strategy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.01,0:22:38.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Jotaro? Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.65,0:23:14.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.69,0:23:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect you to be so close to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.47,0:23:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't guarded the\Nsurroundings with my stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.79,0:23:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have been defeated\Nby an attack from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.81,0:23:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I don't need to detect\Nsounds with this cane anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.35,0:23:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but this cane is needed on the way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.53,0:24:03.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.15,0:24:33.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one removes my hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.09,0:24:34.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even when I go underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.69,0:24:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.05,0:24:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your wound's not fatal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.43,0:24:45.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.21,0:24:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.31,0:24:54.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What made you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.53,0:24:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, weren't you thinking about
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.71,0:25:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forcing me to talk about the\Nstand users you'll be facing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.21,0:25:06.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.31,0:25:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not say anything that\Nwill disadvantage him in any way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.43,0:25:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.19,0:25:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you guys go to such lengths?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.69,0:25:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In general, I am not afraid\Nof dying, not one bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.65,0:25:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because of my standability,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.13,0:25:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was never afraid of\Ndying, even as a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.51,0:25:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact that I was blind\Ndid not bother me either.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.03,0:25:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was able to defeat anyone and\Ncommitting murder meant nothing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.31,0:25:57.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then, for the first time,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.35,0:26:04.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from the bottom of my heart, I felt I\Ndon't want to be killed by this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.69,0:26:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is so very strong,\Nprofound, bold, beautiful,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.69,0:26:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he was the first man in this\Nworld to believe in my worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.69,0:26:26.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a long time, I had\Nbeen waiting to meet him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.29,0:26:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not afraid of dying,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.17,0:26:38.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I can't bear the thought of\Nbeing abandoned and killed by him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.51,0:26:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the evil one needs a savior of evils.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.87,0:26:54.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will tell you one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.45,0:26:58.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Undol.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.55,0:27:03.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stand is the origin of tarot cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.91,0:27:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of the nine Egyptian\Ngods of prosperity,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.83,0:27:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,god of gap.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.49,0:27:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is defined as the deity of earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.63,0:27:18.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nine Gods of Prosperity?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.77,0:27:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.43,0:27:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am only telling you about my own stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.97,0:27:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is the least I can do, Zol\N'ro, for a man who has defeated me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.27,0:27:35.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the first man whom I
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.21,0:27:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wish I could have seen the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.83,0:27:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I pray for your luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.33,0:28:12.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A man with such pride,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.51,0:28:16.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if only we could have met you\Nearlier, before you were introduced
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.23,0:28:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.14,0:28:22.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we could have been\Nfighting for the same side.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.45,0:28:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.36,0:28:24.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rest in peace
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.29,0:28:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,by your cane and duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.13,0:28:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What power he holds, making\Nfanatical believers out of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.19,0:28:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What What kind of man is this Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.01,0:28:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't get so defensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.85,0:28:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not upset about what happened earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.17,0:28:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't blame you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.65,0:29:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be really annoyed too if I was dragged\Ninto the middle of a stupid human battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.15,0:29:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, have a piece of gum.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.87,0:29:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a stubborn, mangy mutt.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.63,0:29:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just be that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.99,0:29:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.05,0:29:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.41,0:29:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty nice thing\Nfor you to do, little fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.71,0:29:45.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.77,0:29:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.27,0:29:51.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you damn dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.25,0:29:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.71,0:30:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.49,0:30:07.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.91,0:30:12.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, look! It's Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.73,0:30:14.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.89,0:30:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.13,0:30:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, what a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.63,0:30:21.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.43,0:31:10.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.03,0:32:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,VINCIROS
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.55,0:32:20.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vincenzo, Vincenzo, Vincenzo, Vincenzo,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.31,0:32:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you in the shadow
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.95,0:32:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.27,0:33:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.

